		</p>

		<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
			{engineeringDecisions.map((dec) => (
				<div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200 shadow-2xs hover:border-[#1a4478]/40 transition-colors">
